01:26:32.625 --> 01:26:38.223
♪ Fill up my eyes ♪

01:26:40.126 --> 01:26:45.758
♪ Galaxies pour down my cheeks ♪

01:26:45.826 --> 01:26:50.821
♪ Galaxies ♪

01:26:52.126 --> 01:26:57.929
♪ Galaxies, they flood the streets ♪

01:26:57.992 --> 01:27:02.589
